<li>"When in doubt, use brute force"</li>
<li>"We have persistent objects, they're called files."</li>
<li>"One of my most productive days was throwing away 1000 lines of code."</li>
<li>"If you want to go somewhere, goto is the best way to get there"</li>
<li>"The X server has to be the biggest program I've ever seen that doesn't do anything for you."</li>
<li>"The act of breaking into a computer system has to have the same social stigma as breaking into a neighbor's house."</li>
</ul>
